{
  "id": "f7_knowledge",
  "intent": "kb_search",
  "kind": "retrieval",
  "description": "How a similar problem was fixed before",
  "anchors": [
    "how to fix",
    "similar issue",
    "how was this fixed before",
    "troubleshooting steps for this problem",
    "what is the solution for this fault",
    "แก้ยังไง",
    "เคยแก้แบบนี้ไหม",
    "หาวิธีแก้ปัญหา",
    "ช่วยหาวิธีการแก้ไขปัญหา",
    "แก้ปัญหานี้ยังไง",
    "วิธีซ่อมเครื่อง",
    "เคยเจอปัญหาแบบนี้ไหม",
    "อาการแบบนี้ต้องแก้ยังไง",
    "เครื่องไม่ทำงาน ต้องแก้ยังไง",
    "ปัญหาใกล้เคียง",
    "ปัญหาที่คล้ายกัน",
    "หาเคสที่คล้ายกับเคสนี้",
    "เคสอื่นที่เจอปัญหาเดียวกัน"
  ],
  "resolve": [],
  "defaults": {},
  "rbac": {
    "requires_permission": "kb.search",
    "team_view": false
  },
  "handler": "knowledge",
  "limit": 5,
  "compose": {
    "headline": "found {n} past cases",
    "row": "{article}|{summary}",
    "cite": "article_id",
    "mode": "summary",
    "columns": [
      {
        "key": "article",
        "type": "text",
        "primary": true
      },
      {
        "key": "summary",
        "type": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  "audit": "ai.kb_search",
  "enabled_by": "company"
}
